# Demo app (demo-app)

Written by Aurora for this agent, except the last section.

## Accounts

Choose an account with the request header `x-aurora-connection-id: <connection id>`. Without it the gateway uses your only account, or refuses when there are several.

- `c_1`: Main

## Your access

- `c_1`: full access

`tools.md` lists every operation and your access to it.

## Skills

Skills from the Demo app app (third-party), in your skills folder. Open the one that matches your task before you start.

- `demo-app-api`: How the API works (`$SKILLS_DIR/demo-app-api/SKILL.md`)
- `demo-app-book`: Book a thing (`$SKILLS_DIR/demo-app-book/SKILL.md`) — a skill of the same name from your workspace is used instead
- `demo-app-own`: Replaced by an agent skill (`$SKILLS_DIR/demo-app-own/SKILL.md`) — a skill of the same name from your agent is used instead
- `demo-app-org`: Replaced by an org skill (`$SKILLS_DIR/demo-app-org/SKILL.md`) — a skill of the same name from your organization is used instead

## Files in this folder

- `tools.md`: every operation and your access to it
- `api.json`: the operations of this app, for `aurora-agent`. Use `aurora-agent search|describe|call <app_id> …` rather than reading it.

## Documentation

- API documentation: https://docs.example.test/api

## Notes from the Demo app plugin (third-party)

